l per month - prorated daily\nWill receive 10 days of free delayed pricing beginning on the date it is delivered. After the intial 10-day free period, a $0.10 per bushel per month DP charge will apply and will be prorated based on the number of days grain remains on DP.\nNew Grain Supplier\nClick Here\nPlease fill out the form above to set up a new grain account with us. Forms can be email to grain@kalmbachfeeds.com or dropped off at our office.\nQuestions- Call the grain team at 419-294-3838 ext. 5\nReceiving Hours:\n10/16\n8:00 AM - 4:30 PM\n10/17 and 10/18\n**Closed this weekend**\n-->\n-->\nContact Us\nKalmbach Feeds Inc. Corporate office\n7148 State Hwy 199\nUpper Sandusky, Ohio 43351\nPhone: (419)-294-3838 ext. 5\nEmail: grain@kalmbachfeeds.com\nSign Up For Alerts!\n© 2026 Barchart.com, Inc. All market data is hosted and powered by Barchart .\nInformation presented is provided 'as-is' and solely for informational purposes, not for trading purposes or advice, and is delayed. No representations are made by Barchart as to its informational accuracy or completeness.\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nDo Not Sell My Personal Information\nExchange Delays\nBy using this site, you agree to the storage of cookies on your devices for enhanced navigation, site analysis, and Barchart's marketing. Data sharing with social media platforms might occur based on the privacy choices you make on those platforms. For specifics, see our our Privacy Policy .\nAccept",
